## ✅ **Adverb of Degree / Quantity (परिमाण / मात्रा के क्रिया विशेषण)**

### 🔹 **Definition**:

An **Adverb of Degree or Quantity** tells **how much**, **to what extent**, or **in what degree** an action, adjective, or another adverb is done.

📌 These adverbs **modify**:

* a **verb**
* an **adjective**
* or another **adverb**

---

## 🧾 **Common Adverbs of Degree/Quantity**:

| **Adverb** | **Meaning** (हिंदी में)       | **Example Sentence**                 |
| ---------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| very       | बहुत                          | She is **very** smart.               |
| quite      | काफी                          | The movie was **quite** interesting. |
| too        | बहुत ज़्यादा (नकारात्मक अर्थ) | It's **too** hot to go outside.      |
| enough     | पर्याप्त                      | He is **old enough** to vote.        |
| almost     | लगभग                          | He **almost** fell.                  |
| nearly     | करीब-करीब                     | We are **nearly** there.             |
| just       | बस अभी                        | I **just** arrived.                  |
| so         | इतना                          | She is **so** beautiful.             |
| extremely  | अत्यधिक                       | He is **extremely** tired.           |
| absolutely | पूर्ण रूप से                  | She is **absolutely** correct.       |
| totally    | पूरी तरह                      | They are **totally** confused.       |
| completely | पूरी तरह                      | I am **completely** ready.           |
| hardly     | मुश्किल से                    | She **hardly** eats anything.        |
| scarcely   | शायद ही                       | I could **scarcely** believe it.     |
| rather     | कुछ अधिक                      | It is **rather** cold today.         |
| almost     | लगभग                          | He has **almost** finished.          |

---

## 🧠 **Usage Tips:**

### 🔸 Modify a **verb**:

* She **almost** cried.
  *(almost modifies the verb "cried")*

### 🔸 Modify an **adjective**:

* He is **too** lazy.
  *(too modifies the adjective "lazy")*

### 🔸 Modify an **adverb**:

* She speaks **very** slowly.
  *(very modifies the adverb "slowly")*

---

## 🚫 **Common Mistakes**:

❌ He is **very enough** strong.
✅ He is **strong enough**.

❌ She is **too beautiful**. (Negative implication)
✅ She is **very beautiful**.

